WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:01.847
States Sue SpaceX

00:00:01.659 --> 00:00:03.038
Over Grok Deepfakes

00:00:03.558 --> 00:00:04.760
The attorneys general

00:00:04.572 --> 00:00:05.550
of Oregon and

00:00:05.362 --> 00:00:06.671
Virginia are suing

00:00:06.483 --> 00:00:07.591
several of Elon

00:00:07.414 --> 00:00:08.723
Musk's companies over

00:00:08.534 --> 00:00:09.855
weak safeguards against

00:00:09.666 --> 00:00:11.034
sexualized imagery

00:00:10.846 --> 00:00:11.848
of real people

00:00:11.966 --> 00:00:13.098
including children

00:00:12.992 --> 00:00:13.852
from Grok

00:00:14.374 --> 00:00:15.541
Both suits name

00:00:15.353 --> 00:00:16.638
SpaceX and X

00:00:16.449 --> 00:00:17.286
Corp.

00:00:17.098 --> 00:00:18.737
the SpaceX subsidiary

00:00:18.584 --> 00:00:19.763
responsible for the

00:00:19.574 --> 00:00:21.024
social media platform

00:00:20.883 --> 00:00:21.437
X

00:00:21.974 --> 00:00:23.023
In the complaints

00:00:23.118 --> 00:00:24.037
the states say

00:00:23.849 --> 00:00:24.933
that Musk leaned

00:00:24.745 --> 00:00:26.136
into Grok’s spicy

00:00:25.948 --> 00:00:26.525
mode

00:00:26.715 --> 00:00:27.315
as a way

00:00:27.127 --> 00:00:28.282
to differentiate the

00:00:28.094 --> 00:00:29.037
model from its

00:00:28.849 --> 00:00:30.205
competitors and that

00:00:30.016 --> 00:00:30.818
this worked

00:00:31.350 --> 00:00:32.364
Full story on

00:00:32.175 --> 00:00:33.071
the dashboard
